Z||000000||1FST2M6||02-26-2000||12:41 AM||||The few of you that have Turbo set ups..  anyone running Intercoolers? air-air or air-water? Anyone running water injection on any setup? And what Turbos are you using? What engine managment systems are you using? HAL-Tec, PMS, Accel dfi??? Just courious...||||reg||1
Z||000001||Eric||02-26-2000||01:05 AM||||I was thinking of running an air to air intercooler mounted under the car with an air dam forcing air into it.  My turbo setup (if I even do it) will be limited to what I can afford to do in a givin period of time.  From what I can tell, the intercooler could provide free or almost free horsepower to a turbocharged engine.  The air tubes could be a problem, but with the manual tranny you're pretty much limited to putting the turbo right where the stock intake tube is.  This should simplify routing.  As far as I know, there is no current turbo "kit" with a standard or even and optional intercooler.  I like a challenge.<P>I was considering nitrous as a possible solution to my lack of hp troubles (185-190 at the crank, sob.), but I'm worried the cost of laughing gas would be way too much for a temporary fix for the hp blues.  The turbo sounds like a better solution.  Man, I wish Stroker was still around.<P>I think the T-3 turbo is the one to use.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Eric||02-26-2000||01:06 AM||||I also want to hear about the electronic solutions.||||reg||1
Z||000003||BBBAD GT||02-26-2000||11:20 AM||||I've been looking into the turbo option, and this web sit has pretty good info  <A HREF="http://members.xoom.com/dlagrua/turbo.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://members.xoom.com/dlagrua/turbo.htm</A> <P>I didn't know the PMS was available for the Fiero, I'm using their system (on my 5.0)before it was the PMS, an Interceptor II from Crane (long story how it first became it from Crane).  Its works pretty good, and it would be excellent for a turbo V6.  Does anybody know anyone using the PMS on thier Fiero?<P> <A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/Fiero.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/Fiero.htm</A>   ||||reg||6
